WEBVTT

00:00:03.370 --> 00:00:07.160
Several Months Ago

00:00:09.290 --> 00:00:13.590
They come from across the galaxy, 31 parts of the Almighty Source.

00:00:13.660 --> 00:00:15.760
It all begins and ends here.

00:00:16.530 --> 00:00:17.730
The Almighty Source?

00:00:18.400 --> 00:00:21.390
Or perhaps I should say, the 31 Primevals.

00:00:21.470 --> 00:00:25.840
So EI-01, who vanished underground, wasn't our only enemy?

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:30.040
The progenitors of the Zonderians... that's what the 31 Primevals are.

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:40.390
The technology bestowed upon mankind by the G-Stone...

00:00:40.460 --> 00:00:44.330
...had enabled them to build a large-scale base in outer space.

00:00:44.530 --> 00:00:48.120
The Orbit Base. It is Earth's defense system...

00:00:48.200 --> 00:00:51.960
...built in satellite orbit and housing four mobile defense ships!

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.070
And so all preparations for repulsing the 31 Primevals are now complete!

00:00:58.230 --> 00:01:01.230
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:01.230 --> 00:01:04.130
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:05.140 --> 00:01:11.060
King of Braves GaoGaiGar

00:01:11.500 --> 00:01:15.750
Run, you powerful Robot Brigade!

00:01:17.170 --> 00:01:21.980
With your red gaze and your silver chest!

00:01:23.130 --> 00:01:26.070
The G-Stone is your bond with the lion

00:01:26.070 --> 00:01:30.770
to save the future of outer space.

00:01:30.770 --> 00:01:34.730
It's time to launch!

00:01:34.730 --> 00:01:37.910
Destroying the souls of the people...

00:01:37.910 --> 00:01:41.830
Smash the Zonder Metal to pieces!

00:01:43.650 --> 00:01:46.530
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!

00:01:46.530 --> 00:01:49.490
Ga-Ga-Ga, Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:01:49.490 --> 00:01:52.410
}Final Fusion, approved!

00:01:52.410 --> 00:01:55.160
Now transform into a superhero!

00:01:55.370 --> 00:01:58.670
Pulverizing steel!

00:01:58.670 --> 00:02:02.340
Goldion Hammer!

00:02:04.200 --> 00:02:09.870
Magic! Drive! Ultimate power! Guts!

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:15.870
A hero is born! Great God of Iron...

00:02:15.870 --> 00:02:18.690
Our very own King of Braves!

00:02:18.690 --> 00:02:22.870
Ga-Ga-Ga-Ga, GaoGaiGar!!

00:02:23.160 --> 00:02:26.990
You are hereby ordered to fuse with the Ultimate King of Braves legend!

00:02:30.030 --> 00:02:30.070
Journey to Absolute Zero

00:02:31.140 --> 00:02:32.990
<i>Journey to Absolute Zero</i>

00:02:37.910 --> 00:02:41.640
The Bay Tower Base has been destroyed by the 31 Machine Primevals...

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:45.980
...leaving GaoGaiGar with no choice but to wage a solitary battle.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:48.610
Fusion!

00:02:49.350 --> 00:02:51.720
J-Bird! Plug Out!

00:02:55.290 --> 00:02:58.160
King J-Der!

00:03:03.200 --> 00:03:05.130
J-Quath!

00:03:07.100 --> 00:03:09.830
Suddenly a mysterious Battleship Robot appears...

00:03:09.910 --> 00:03:11.880
...and vanquishes the Primeval Robots!

00:03:19.620 --> 00:03:24.580
But the enemy continues to arrive on Earth through an "ES Window".

00:03:24.690 --> 00:03:28.450
The 13-robot Mic Sounders Brigade rushes forth to intercept them!

00:03:28.830 --> 00:03:31.820
Mic Sounders!

00:03:38.340 --> 00:03:42.240
The enemy force is gradually diminished by Mic and the others.

00:03:42.310 --> 00:03:44.970
And again, it is the white battleship that comes to their rescue.

00:03:47.710 --> 00:03:49.300
So there's 28 of them in all?

00:03:49.510 --> 00:03:53.310
If you count the 3 that were destroyed the other day it's 31 total.

00:03:53.380 --> 00:03:54.850
So there's no mistake, eh?

00:03:55.290 --> 00:03:57.250
The 31 Machine Primevals...

00:03:57.390 --> 00:04:01.650
As in the case of EI-01, I wasn't able to continue tracking them.

00:04:02.930 --> 00:04:05.760
They were destroyed all the way to their cores.

00:04:06.030 --> 00:04:08.330
It's not likely that they'll regenerate anytime soon.

00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:09.890
I just hope you're right about that.

00:04:10.400 --> 00:04:11.730
At the very least...

00:04:12.200 --> 00:04:15.540
...we were able to prevent the instantaneous annihilation of Earth.

00:04:18.840 --> 00:04:20.970
But hey, I was never so surprised in my life!

00:04:21.040 --> 00:04:23.910
I can't believe they built an amazing base like this!

00:04:24.050 --> 00:04:26.570
Hey, it's still too soon for you to be blown away!

00:04:30.950 --> 00:04:33.220
Welcome to the Second Order Room!

00:04:33.390 --> 00:04:34.410
Uncle Liger!

00:04:34.490 --> 00:04:36.120
Hey, these people are...

00:04:38.200 --> 00:04:39.220
Nice to see you again.

00:04:41.570 --> 00:04:44.230
Allow me to show you the power of Isolde!

00:04:50.540 --> 00:04:52.480
I am deeply indebted to you all.

00:05:10.330 --> 00:05:12.090
Zonder!

00:05:24.370 --> 00:05:27.900
Being Zonderized was the twist of fate that led us to be employed here.

00:05:27.980 --> 00:05:32.210
We three were invited to come work here as members of the technical staff.

00:05:32.350 --> 00:05:34.280
Now then, why don't we show you the fruits of their labor?

00:05:39.360 --> 00:05:40.550
Waha!

00:05:40.620 --> 00:05:42.150
This is Division I...

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:44.830
...the Ul-Tech Engine Drive Space Carrier Base, Izanagi.

00:05:45.530 --> 00:05:49.800
It can fly freely in and out of the stratosphere to deploy the GGG mechas.

00:05:50.400 --> 00:05:54.600
This is Division II, the Multi-Purpose Special Machine Ship, Kanayago.

00:05:55.170 --> 00:05:58.470
It's a Special Duty Ship equipped to perform a diverse array of tasks.

00:05:59.480 --> 00:06:00.600
This is Division III...

00:06:00.840 --> 00:06:03.940
...the Ul-Tech Engine Drive Command, Comm and Control Ship, Susanoh.

00:06:04.010 --> 00:06:06.810
It's the fastest in the entire fleet...

00:06:06.880 --> 00:06:08.910
...and with its cutting-edge sensors and computer system...

00:06:08.990 --> 00:06:11.480
...it can swiftly analyze any battle situation.

00:06:15.030 --> 00:06:17.620
And as you know, this is Division IV...

00:06:17.690 --> 00:06:20.690
...the High-Mobility Twin-Hull Supply and Maintenance Ship, Amaterasu.

00:06:20.760 --> 00:06:23.100
It performs maintenance and repairs on the GGG mechas.

00:06:23.170 --> 00:06:24.900
It's a moving factory, so to speak.

00:06:28.940 --> 00:06:32.340
Nozaki here will be in charge of all System Design for the Division Fleet.

00:06:32.880 --> 00:06:33.500
Yes...

00:06:33.940 --> 00:06:37.850
In charge of the system control software and security for the Orbit Base...

00:06:37.910 --> 00:06:39.470
...is Inubouzaki.

00:06:39.550 --> 00:06:40.170
That's right.

00:06:41.080 --> 00:06:45.420
In charge of the Gravity Control Unit and the Artificial Gravity Generating System...

00:06:45.490 --> 00:06:46.750
...is Hirata.

00:06:47.660 --> 00:06:49.250
My theories are foolproof!

00:06:49.430 --> 00:06:52.690
Everyone's been hired to help out with their respective expertise, you see.

00:06:52.900 --> 00:06:54.560
Really? Wow!

00:06:54.630 --> 00:06:57.730
But the enemy's attack came sooner than we expected.

00:06:58.070 --> 00:07:03.170
It will take some time before we can get the Orbit Base running at 100%.

00:07:03.310 --> 00:07:04.330
Not only that, but...

00:07:14.050 --> 00:07:15.280
Big Sister Mikoto...

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:17.690
They're all gonna get well, aren't they?

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:20.120
We've finished their external repairs...

00:07:20.190 --> 00:07:23.160
...but the most important thing, their Al systems, are completely fried.

00:07:23.230 --> 00:07:25.320
All we can do now is put our faith in...

00:07:25.400 --> 00:07:28.300
...their internal program restoration functions.

00:07:29.200 --> 00:07:32.860
They're all brave heroes who've won countless battles.

00:07:33.640 --> 00:07:35.260
I'm sure they'll wake up sooner or later!

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.070
Yeah, they will, won't they?

00:07:47.550 --> 00:07:51.250
Isn't there any way to find the 31 Primevals that fell to Earth?

00:07:52.360 --> 00:07:54.920
It won't be long before the Orbit Base is complete...

00:07:54.990 --> 00:07:57.320
...so we're just going to have to be patient, I guess.

00:07:57.590 --> 00:07:59.080
We're gonna do everything we can...

00:07:59.160 --> 00:08:01.890
...so you'd better not push yourself over the limit, Gai!

00:08:03.100 --> 00:08:05.530
It looks like they've sustained a lot of damage.

00:08:08.110 --> 00:08:09.700
Hi, Mamoru!

00:08:09.770 --> 00:08:11.500
So you made it, Mic!

00:08:12.910 --> 00:08:14.930
You're going home now, aren't you?

00:08:15.010 --> 00:08:18.450
Then you should ride in my Baribarien, okay?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:19.610
But...

00:08:21.020 --> 00:08:22.310
No problem!

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:26.250
My brothers are gonna need some time getting fixed up...

00:08:26.320 --> 00:08:27.920
...but they all survived, you know!

00:08:28.430 --> 00:08:33.230
And besides, we promised each other to play a lot after the operation!

00:08:36.130 --> 00:08:39.330
Okay, then... Big Brother Gai, Big Sister Mikoto, thanks for everything!

00:08:42.710 --> 00:08:43.670
Whoops!

00:08:43.870 --> 00:08:44.600
Hold on!

00:08:45.540 --> 00:08:47.170
I almost forgot!

00:08:47.280 --> 00:08:48.870
It's your new GGG pager!

00:08:49.180 --> 00:08:51.610
It works over the satellite network, so...

00:08:51.680 --> 00:08:53.770
...you can use it anywhere in the world!

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:54.710
Waha!

00:08:54.950 --> 00:08:56.080
We're counting on you, Mamoru.

00:08:56.150 --> 00:08:59.650
Remember, we'll always be part of the brave GGG team!

00:09:00.090 --> 00:09:01.060
Right!

00:09:09.430 --> 00:09:10.230
Waha!

00:09:10.300 --> 00:09:11.670
Here we go, Mamoru!

00:09:11.740 --> 00:09:14.530
Time for Mirror-Coating!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:26.910
For once, I admit I'm wiped out.

00:09:27.180 --> 00:09:29.020
After all, so much happened...

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.060
Who's there?

00:09:35.130 --> 00:09:35.990
Huh?

00:09:40.930 --> 00:09:43.660
I guess I really am exhausted...

00:09:48.710 --> 00:09:51.040
Goodbye, Mamoru!

00:09:55.150 --> 00:09:56.810
I'm home!

00:10:03.020 --> 00:10:04.490
Welcome home, Mamoru.

00:10:04.550 --> 00:10:06.080
Good to have you home, Mamoru.

00:10:06.260 --> 00:10:07.690
Waha!

00:10:07.890 --> 00:10:09.690
Was it a lot of hard work, Mamoru?

00:10:09.860 --> 00:10:13.190
Well, um... you see... uh...

00:10:13.500 --> 00:10:17.020
Oh, never mind, it's okay. You don't have to tell us anything.

00:10:17.100 --> 00:10:21.760
That's right. After all, you came home, just like you promised!

00:10:22.340 --> 00:10:23.600
But why wouldn't I?

00:10:23.670 --> 00:10:25.970
I mean, this is my home, right?

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:27.700
Of course I'd come home!

00:10:28.280 --> 00:10:30.750
Yes, you're right.

00:10:32.320 --> 00:10:35.220
Anyway, Ai, let's have dinner soon.

00:10:35.290 --> 00:10:37.340
You must be hungry, aren't you, Mamoru?

00:10:37.420 --> 00:10:38.150
Yeah!

00:10:38.220 --> 00:10:40.160
Daddy's hungry, too!

00:10:40.560 --> 00:10:42.050
Mommy's hungry, too!

00:10:42.260 --> 00:10:44.230
Waha!

00:10:52.270 --> 00:10:53.860
Now that I'm here at home...

00:10:53.940 --> 00:10:58.370
...it's hard to believe that I was fighting alongside everyone at GGG.

00:11:01.310 --> 00:11:02.280
But...

00:11:03.380 --> 00:11:08.080
I wonder why I have this power, that nobody else seems to have?

00:11:10.420 --> 00:11:14.120
The Machine of Destruction created by Cain...

00:11:14.790 --> 00:11:17.020
Could it be that this power of mine...

00:11:25.370 --> 00:11:26.600
Waha!

00:11:26.670 --> 00:11:30.570
Mamoru, we haven't done this in a long time, let's scrub each other's backs!

00:11:31.910 --> 00:11:35.310
Listen, I was thinking, do you want to go fishing during our next holiday?

00:11:35.380 --> 00:11:36.710
Let's ask Hana to come, too!

00:11:37.210 --> 00:11:39.980
For real? But you're busy, aren't you, Dad?

00:11:40.050 --> 00:11:42.640
It's all right, it's all right. I'm going to take some time off!

00:11:43.190 --> 00:11:44.780
How sweet!

00:11:44.920 --> 00:11:46.820
It's just the boys!

00:11:53.500 --> 00:11:57.360
The offshore mining plant, Explorer 7...

00:11:57.500 --> 00:12:02.100
It is a gigantic seaborne complex built by the U.S.A. in order to...

00:12:02.170 --> 00:12:08.110
...mine, research, and refine offshore oil fields in the Arctic Ocean.

00:12:22.230 --> 00:12:25.320
Electromagnetic wave control capacity...

00:12:25.960 --> 00:12:28.260
...now in progress...

00:12:28.870 --> 00:12:31.330
Mission success rate...

00:12:31.970 --> 00:12:36.200
...99.92%.

00:12:47.080 --> 00:12:53.610
So in other words, this planet is now under threat of an alien invasion.

00:12:54.290 --> 00:12:56.520
And in order to protect us all...

00:12:56.590 --> 00:13:02.960
...an organization called the Gutsy Galaxy Guard, or GGG, has been created.

00:13:03.030 --> 00:13:05.470
Invaders from outer space, the Zonderians...

00:13:05.870 --> 00:13:09.640
...and the organization created to stop them, GGG...

00:13:10.310 --> 00:13:14.110
Approximately 3 years have gone by since Earth's first contact with EI-01.

00:13:14.880 --> 00:13:17.010
And now for the first time...

00:13:17.080 --> 00:13:21.310
...civilians are being made aware of the nature of their battle to save mankind.

00:13:24.550 --> 00:13:27.250
If you ever witness something suspicious going on.

00:13:27.320 --> 00:13:31.020
Please call the GGG Hotline written here.

00:13:31.090 --> 00:13:34.500
Hey, is it true that your big brother works for GGG?

00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:38.390
Yeah! The other day he got transferred to the base in outer space...

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:41.100
...so he only comes home once a week!

00:13:41.170 --> 00:13:45.610
Wow! Outer space! You mean, the real outer space?

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:49.040
That's right! When I grow up, I'm also gonna join GGG...

00:13:49.110 --> 00:13:51.140
...and go work in their outer space base!

00:13:51.210 --> 00:13:53.940
Of course, that's assuming this planet will still be around then!

00:13:54.280 --> 00:13:56.120
Outer space, huh?

00:13:56.650 --> 00:14:00.050
Hey, Mamoru, don't you want to go someday, too?

00:14:01.190 --> 00:14:02.120
Mamoru!

00:14:02.190 --> 00:14:02.850
Huh?

00:14:04.760 --> 00:14:06.130
Oh, yeah, yeah!

00:14:06.460 --> 00:14:08.120
All right, boys and girls!

00:14:08.200 --> 00:14:11.000
Under no circumstances should you make any prank calls, is that clear?

00:14:11.070 --> 00:14:12.300
Yes, ma'am!

00:14:15.440 --> 00:14:16.800
What? Fishing?

00:14:16.870 --> 00:14:19.430
My dad said to ask you to come along, too!

00:14:19.510 --> 00:14:21.740
Really? I'll go! I'll go!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:23.550
Yay!

00:14:23.850 --> 00:14:25.510
We'll be together, Mamoru!

00:14:25.980 --> 00:14:26.710
Huh?

00:14:27.380 --> 00:14:28.580
See you!

00:14:29.820 --> 00:14:31.620
Together with Hana, huh?

00:14:34.160 --> 00:14:35.120
Together?

00:14:38.860 --> 00:14:39.490
Huh?

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.520
K-Kaidou!

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:53.370
Huh? It's that white battleship!

00:14:57.550 --> 00:14:58.480
Let's go.

00:14:58.850 --> 00:15:00.650
What do you mean? Where?

00:15:01.020 --> 00:15:03.140
You can do it too, can't you?

00:15:36.850 --> 00:15:39.080
You're one of the Four Machine Kings... Pizza!

00:15:39.220 --> 00:15:40.880
That's not my true name.

00:15:40.960 --> 00:15:41.510
Huh?

00:15:41.590 --> 00:15:43.860
The man you knew as Pizza is dead.

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:46.150
My name is J.

00:15:46.900 --> 00:15:50.420
The J-Jewel guided me, and resurrected me as Soldatoo-J

00:15:50.500 --> 00:15:52.760
Soldatoo-J?

00:15:53.070 --> 00:15:55.830
I hear that on Earth, they call you Mamoru.

00:15:55.970 --> 00:15:56.700
Huh?

00:15:57.340 --> 00:15:58.640
Consider this a warning.

00:15:58.840 --> 00:16:01.210
You are not to interfere with us again.

00:16:01.510 --> 00:16:03.500
If you do get in our way...

00:16:03.580 --> 00:16:06.140
...you and your comrades shall be recognized as the enemy.

00:16:06.220 --> 00:16:07.740
On Earth?

00:16:07.950 --> 00:16:09.250
Get in your way?

00:16:11.120 --> 00:16:13.320
Are they on the move, Arma?

00:16:14.220 --> 00:16:15.710
Far, far north...

00:16:16.190 --> 00:16:17.990
Far off in the northern seas...

00:16:18.630 --> 00:16:19.150
All right.

00:16:26.940 --> 00:16:28.030
Launch!

00:16:28.100 --> 00:16:29.470
J-Ark!

00:16:30.040 --> 00:16:31.010
J-Ark?

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:42.200
His home has exploded in the destructive flames of war.

00:16:31.550 --> 00:16:42.200
Furusato wa horobi no senka ni chitta

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:53.780
There's no planet for him to return to in this lonely galaxy.

00:16:42.320 --> 00:16:53.780
Kaeru hoshi ni naki kokou no ginga

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.020
Huh?

00:16:47.120 --> 00:16:48.390
What is that?

00:16:49.960 --> 00:16:52.120
I'd better call GGG!

00:16:55.570 --> 00:17:06.180
All of the warrior's sorrow and tears have long since dried.

00:16:55.570 --> 00:17:06.180
Kanashimi mo namida mo karehateta senshi

00:16:55.830 --> 00:16:56.890
Well?

00:16:57.370 --> 00:16:59.030
Isn't the sky divine?

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:18.720
His noble blood begins to roar.

00:17:06.620 --> 00:17:18.720
Kedakaki chi wa hoeru tsubasa wo hirogete

00:17:12.080 --> 00:17:16.070
Here's an ultra-ultra-enhanced image taken over the satellite network.

00:17:16.150 --> 00:17:17.550
Is it the white battleship?

00:17:17.620 --> 00:17:22.020
It seems to be equipped with a system able to thwart all kinds of sensors.

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:24.950
The ultimate battleship...

00:17:19.500 --> 00:17:24.950
Choudokyuu senkan

00:17:22.560 --> 00:17:24.390
If it hadn't been for that civilian calling in...

00:17:24.460 --> 00:17:26.160
...I wouldn't have been able to trace its route.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:30.100
Soar away into the gorgeous sky.

00:17:24.950 --> 00:17:30.100
utsukushiki sora he habatake

00:17:26.230 --> 00:17:27.920
What on earth are they planning to do?

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.590
It's heading for the Arctic Ocean, making steady progress!

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:35.560
The ultimate battleship...

00:17:30.100 --> 00:17:35.560
Choudokyuu senkan

00:17:33.540 --> 00:17:34.830
I want you to keep tracking it!

00:17:34.900 --> 00:17:38.140
We're going to find out who's behind that white battleship no matter what!

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:41.150
The J-Jewel calls you

00:17:35.560 --> 00:17:41.150
J-Jueru no michibiki ga

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:51.450
and will guide you.

00:17:41.150 --> 00:17:51.450
omae wo yondeiru

00:17:53.720 --> 00:17:54.690
What's that?

00:17:57.630 --> 00:17:59.560
J-Ark, enter Combat Mode!

00:17:59.630 --> 00:18:00.600
Roger!

00:18:01.530 --> 00:18:04.360
Maximum battle speed! Open all gunports!

00:18:04.730 --> 00:18:06.500
Open the missile launching tube!

00:18:07.440 --> 00:18:08.560
Prepare for a blitz attack!

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:16.160
The ultimate battleship...

00:18:10.380 --> 00:18:16.160
Choudokyuu senkan

00:18:14.140 --> 00:18:15.840
Prepare to fire the Antimeson Cannons!

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:20.990
I want to fight with you.

00:18:16.160 --> 00:18:20.990
omae to tomo ni tatakau

00:18:18.250 --> 00:18:19.680
Range correction!

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:26.660
The ultimate battleship...

00:18:20.990 --> 00:18:26.660
Choudokyuu senkan

00:18:22.690 --> 00:18:24.410
Fire from all gunports!

00:18:26.590 --> 00:18:27.020
Fire!

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:32.130
it's human form

00:18:26.660 --> 00:18:32.130
oshiki sono sugata wa

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:47.600
is the lord of space!

00:18:32.130 --> 00:18:47.600
uchuu no ouja

00:18:35.630 --> 00:18:37.860
Oh, so that's your plan, eh?

00:18:43.140 --> 00:18:44.970
Anti-air missiles, fire!

00:18:51.610 --> 00:18:54.910
Are you saying that Explorer 7 has been taken over by the 31 Primevals?

00:18:55.350 --> 00:18:57.250
There's no other explanation.

00:18:57.320 --> 00:19:00.920
Those pillars are made of unbelievably powerful electromagnetic waves!

00:19:00.990 --> 00:19:02.720
Pillars of ice made of electromagnetic waves?

00:19:02.790 --> 00:19:05.960
By interacting with the water's molecular structure with those...

00:19:06.030 --> 00:19:08.090
...electromagnetic waves, it's attaining perfect order at 0 Kelvin.

00:19:08.160 --> 00:19:12.660
In other words, it's creating a -273 Celsius environment!

00:19:13.140 --> 00:19:14.330
You mean absolute zero degrees?

00:19:14.700 --> 00:19:17.200
It has absolute control over free molecules.

00:19:17.270 --> 00:19:19.140
It's what you'd call an electromagnetic wave monster!

00:19:19.710 --> 00:19:24.670
Still, why would the white battleship go into battle against the 31 Primevals?

00:19:24.950 --> 00:19:27.610
Are they the enemy? Or are they...

00:19:30.490 --> 00:19:32.680
Load the ES Missile!

00:19:32.860 --> 00:19:34.220
Loading process complete!

00:19:34.520 --> 00:19:35.080
Fire!

00:19:43.500 --> 00:19:44.660
Now's our chance to get close.

00:19:47.040 --> 00:19:49.770
If I hit it with my  Antimeson Cannons at point-blank range...

00:19:51.370 --> 00:19:54.970
Explorer 7, still under the control of the 31 Primevals...

00:19:55.040 --> 00:19:57.670
...is advancing towards the Queen Elizabeth Islands...

00:19:57.750 --> 00:20:00.010
...even as it fights off the white battleship!

00:20:00.080 --> 00:20:04.380
What's that? Chief! You've got to launch the Division ships right away!

00:20:04.450 --> 00:20:05.650
Before it's too late!

00:20:06.160 --> 00:20:07.320
What do you mean by that?

00:20:07.390 --> 00:20:09.760
I've discovered the enemy's true purpose!

00:20:10.060 --> 00:20:11.820
The power to achieve Absolute Zero...

00:20:11.890 --> 00:20:14.730
...is nothing but a by-product of its true purpose!

00:20:14.960 --> 00:20:19.400
It's heading for the planet's north geomagnetic pole... the North Pole!

00:20:19.800 --> 00:20:21.060
What does that have to do with...

00:20:21.170 --> 00:20:23.970
If the Van Allen Radiation Belt surrounding Earth is removed...

00:20:24.040 --> 00:20:27.740
...all living creatures on Earth will be wiped out by deadly cosmic rays!

00:20:34.950 --> 00:20:36.380
What?

00:20:51.630 --> 00:20:53.430
All gunports, prepare to fire!

00:21:23.030 --> 00:21:26.970
As of this moment, the seaborne plant advancing towards the Arctic Ocean...

00:21:27.040 --> 00:21:29.400
...shall be officially known as ZX-04.

00:21:30.470 --> 00:21:32.940
Division I, Izanagi! Emergency launch!

00:21:33.010 --> 00:21:35.810
Set off for the Arctic Ocean immediately after launch!

00:21:40.880 --> 00:21:44.080
Gai, you still haven't made a full recovery yet, so don't push yourself!

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.120
I know.

00:21:45.390 --> 00:21:46.290
Just leave it to me.

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:56.320
The Van Allen Belt is formed by particles in Earth's geomagnetic field.

00:21:56.800 --> 00:21:59.630
Apparently, ZX-04's goal is to disrupt Earth's magnetic field...

00:21:59.700 --> 00:22:01.500
...with an enormous electromagnetic wave...

00:22:01.570 --> 00:22:03.200
...extinguish the Van Allen Belt...

00:22:03.270 --> 00:22:06.300
...and weaken all forms of life on this planet.

00:22:08.040 --> 00:22:09.380
Just you wait...

00:22:09.650 --> 00:22:11.510
...you electromagnetic monster!

00:22:12.350 --> 00:22:14.910
Destruction of the Earth's environment...

00:22:15.150 --> 00:22:16.910
Resistance, impossible...

00:22:17.450 --> 00:22:20.120
All of mankind to be Zonderized...

00:22:21.460 --> 00:22:26.950
The mysterious battleship, the J-Ark, has challenged the 31 Primevals...

00:22:27.700 --> 00:22:32.860
...but the white ship is about to sink into the roiling arctic sea.

00:22:33.740 --> 00:22:35.670
With its warriors out of commission...

00:22:35.740 --> 00:22:41.180
...can GGG still find a way to save Mamoru and the rest of mankind?

00:22:46.550 --> 00:22:50.450
Even if there are more than a million stars between us...

00:22:51.650 --> 00:22:55.320
...I know I can get there without losing my way.

00:22:56.720 --> 00:23:01.500
Because I can see the road that leads to you.

00:23:01.500 --> 00:23:06.290
It's sparkling ahead of me.

00:23:06.920 --> 00:23:10.460
The journey I began that day...

00:23:11.630 --> 00:23:17.390
...will surely make our bond even stronger.

00:23:19.450 --> 00:23:24.150
The wings that send me into the galaxy...

00:23:24.150 --> 00:23:28.810
...let's believe in them now.

00:23:29.500 --> 00:23:34.150
When you and I are grown up

00:23:34.150 --> 00:23:41.150
someday in the Sea of Stars.

00:23:45.570 --> 00:23:48.370
Now releasing the latest intelligence.

00:23:48.680 --> 00:23:51.170
When an aurora surrounds the entire planet...

00:23:51.250 --> 00:23:54.050
...all living things on Earth are doomed to die.

00:23:54.180 --> 00:23:57.280
It is then that the sound of a steel hero's heartbeat...

00:23:57.350 --> 00:23:59.450
...rings out across the icy plains.

00:23:59.860 --> 00:24:03.220
That's right, that's right. This is the moment we've been waiting for!

00:24:03.730 --> 00:24:05.690
Next episode of GaoGaiGar, King of Braves...

00:24:05.760 --> 00:24:07.060
"The Brave Heroes Resurrected!"

00:24:06.500 --> 00:24:06.540
The Brave Heroes Resurrected

00:24:07.130 --> 00:24:10.330
Make sure you stay tuned for the order..."Final Fusion Approved!"

00:24:12.270 --> 00:24:15.070
GGG Mobile Force
Strikes Back

00:24:13.170 --> 00:24:14.800
This is the Key to Victory!
